    "description": "<p>As a <a href=\"/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, as many times as equal to half your Corporate Agent level, you can grant an ally within line of sight a temporary boost to their Speed, attack rolls, or <a href=\"/wiki/Defenses\" title=\"Defenses\">Defenses</a>. Until the end of their turn, they gain one of the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Increase their base Speed by 2 squares.</li><li>Add a +2 morale boost to their attack rolls.</li><li>Add a +2 morale boost to all their <a href=\"/wiki/Defenses\" title=\"Defenses\">Defenses</a>.</li></ul>",
